{"slug":"Minor_Updates_of_23.x","title":"Minor Updates of 23.x","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"Versions","text":"Versions","level":2},{"id":"v23.1","text":"v23.1","level":3},{"id":"v23.2","text":"v23.2","level":3},{"id":"v23.3","text":"v23.3","level":3},{"id":"v23.4","text":"v23.4","level":3},{"id":"v23.5","text":"v23.5","level":3},{"id":"v23.6","text":"v23.6","level":3},{"id":"v23.7","text":"v23.7","level":3},{"id":"v23.8","text":"v23.8","level":3},{"id":"v23.9","text":"v23.9","level":3},{"id":"v23.10","text":"v23.10","level":3},{"id":"v23.11","text":"v23.11","level":3},{"id":"v23.12","text":"v23.12","level":3},{"id":"v23.13","text":"v23.13","level":3},{"id":"v23.14","text":"v23.14","level":3},{"id":"v23.15","text":"v23.15","level":3},{"id":"v23.16","text":"v23.16","level":3},{"id":"v23.17","text":"v23.17","level":3},{"id":"v23.18","text":"v23.18","level":3},{"id":"v23.19","text":"v23.19","level":3}],"html":"<p>Minor versions of <a href=\"/OpenFront.io\" title=\"OpenFront.io\">OpenFront</a> <a href=\"/Update_23.0\" title=\"Update 23.0\">Update 0.23</a>\n</p><p>For the latest information, visit <a href=\"/Discord\" title=\"Discord\">Discord</a>\n</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Versions\">Versions</h2></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.1\">v23.1</h3></div>\n<p>31 May 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Fix unable to join public game, minor meta tweaks</li></ul>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.2\">v23.2</h3></div>\n<p>1 June 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Slow down attacks</li>\n<li>Make bots weaker</li>\n<li>Increase defense</li>\n<li>Fix Translations showing as untranslated keys</li>\n<li>Cap lobby sizes at 150</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.2\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.3\">v23.3</h3></div>\n<p>1 June 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Slight nerf to gold production by large players</li>\n<li>Speed boost for very large attacks</li>\n<li>5% speed buff for mountains</li>\n<li>Defense post boost</li>\n<li>Small trade ship spawn rate increase</li>\n<li>Attack losses up 20% for all attacks</li>\n<li>Small speed effect boost for defense posts</li>\n<li>20% population growth decrease for large players</li>\n<li>Nerfed worker growth boost slightly</li>\n<li>Nerfed troop/worker conversion rate</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.3\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.4\">v23.4</h3></div>\n<p>2 June 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Revert to v22 meta</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.4\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.5\">v23.5</h3></div>\n<p>2 June 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Fixed low trade ship spawn rate</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.5\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.6\">v23.6</h3></div>\n<p>3 June 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Minor bugfixes</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.6\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.7\">v23.7</h3></div>\n<p>4 June 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Fixed unable to join lobby bug &amp; replays bug</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.7\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.8\">v23.8</h3></div>\n<p>7 June 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Fixed discord logout bug</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.8\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.9\">v23.9</h3></div>\n<p>8 June 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Fixed broken flag paths</li>\n<li>Disabled donations</li>\n<li>FFA public matches</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.9\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.10\">v23.10</h3></div>\n<p>13 June 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Fixed quick chat text injection</li>\n<li>Fixed certain flags making it so user can't join game</li>\n<li>Fixed a bug where nukes weren't reducing troops in boats</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.10\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.11\">v23.11</h3></div>\n<p>11 June 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Fixed bug unable to deselect certain units in private games. Added front page ads</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.11\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.12\">v23.12</h3></div>\n<p>18 June 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Moved ads to win/lose screen</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.12\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.13\">v23.13</h3></div>\n<p>19 June 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Bottom banner ad during spawn phase</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.13\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.14\">v23.14</h3></div>\n<p>20 June 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Fixed an exploit causing the game to crash</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.14\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.15\">v23.15</h3></div>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.15\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.16\">v23.16</h3></div>\n<p>29 June 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Added Italia &amp; Strait of Gibralter</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.16\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.17\">v23.17</h3></div>\n<p>7 July 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Migrated to GitHub Deployments.</li>\n<li>Added release notes to news modal.</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.17\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.18\">v23.18</h3></div>\n<p>18 July 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Removed spawn advertisement that failed to disable properly when spawning concluded.</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.18\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"v23.19\">v23.19</h3></div>\n<p>18 July 2025\n</p>\n<ul><li>Remove spawn ads completely.</li></ul>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/releases/tag/v0.23.19\" target=\"_blank\">Link to Github release</a>\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"See_also\">See also</h1></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Update_23.0\" title=\"Update 23.0\">Update 0.23</a></li></ul>","section":"Updates"}
